    "integration.title": "Sens\u00f6rden Eyleme",
    "integration.subtitle": "Bir sens\u00f6r rulman a\u015f\u0131nmas\u0131n\u0131 tespit eder. Bir AI modeli ar\u0131zay\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131r \u2014 veya bir teknisyen mobil uygulamadan te\u015fhis kaydeder. Her iki durumda da IAES tek bir olay\u0131 \u00fc\u00e7 sisteme ayn\u0131 anda y\u00f6nlendirir.",
    "integration.sensor": "Titre\u015fim Sens\u00f6r\u00fc",
    "integration.intelligence": "AI / Uzman / Uygulama",
    "integration.sap": "IW31 bildirimi",
    "integration.maintainx": "MaintainX i\u015f emri atand\u0131",
    "integration.grafana": "Grafana uyar\u0131 paneli tetiklendi",
    "integration.note": "Tek olay, \u00fc\u00e7 t\u00fcketici. Her hedef sistem i\u00e7in \u00f6zel entegrasyon yok. Zek\u00e2 yapay olsun ya da insani \u2014 olay format\u0131 ayn\u0131d\u0131r.",
    "incident.title": "Olay Ya\u015fam D\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc",
    "incident.subtitle": "Tesptten \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcme kadar eksiksiz bir olay. D\u00f6rt IAES olay\u0131 hikayenin tamam\u0131n\u0131 anlat\u0131r \u2014 uyar\u0131y\u0131 kapatmak i\u00e7in insan m\u00fcdahalesi gerekmez.",
    "incident.onset_desc": "G\u00fc\u00e7 fakt\u00f6r\u00fc 0,91\u2019e d\u00fc\u015fer. Kural motoru ihlali tespit eder. Yeni correlation_id olu\u015fturulur. \u0130lk uyar\u0131 olu\u015fturulur.",
    "incident.escalation_desc": "G\u00fc\u00e7 fakt\u00f6r\u00fc daha da d\u00fc\u015ferek 0,84 olur. severity, medium\u2019dan high\u2019a y\u00fckseltilir. Ayn\u0131 correlation_id. M\u00fckerrer uyar\u0131 yok \u2014 mevcut uyar\u0131 g\u00fcncellenir.",
    "incident.wo_desc": "T\u00fcketici MaintainX\u2019te bir i\u015f emri olu\u015fturur. Ayn\u0131 correlation_id ile ba\u011flant\u0131l\u0131d\u0131r. Teknisyen kondansat\u00f6r bankas\u0131n\u0131 incelemek \u00fczere g\u00f6nderilir.",
    "incident.recovery_desc": "G\u00fc\u00e7 fakt\u00f6r\u00fc art arda 5 okuma i\u00e7in 0,97\u2019ye d\u00f6ner. severity: info ve condition_trend: improving ile kurtarma olay\u0131 yay\u0131nlan\u0131r. Uyar\u0131 otomatik olarak \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcl\u00fcr.",
    "incident.correlation": "correlation_id: 3b2f9d8c-1c33-4a8a \u2014 4 olay\u0131n tamam\u0131 ayn\u0131 kimli\u011fi payla\u015f\u0131r. Tek olay, tek iz, tam izlenebilirlik.",
